WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 29

01:27.800 --> 01:30.320
(Earl Dongping's Mansion, Jiang)

01:30.620 --> 01:31.950
At this point,

01:31.970 --> 01:33.330
you still refuse to tell the truth?

01:33.330 --> 01:34.690
Hurry and confess honestly.

01:34.690 --> 01:37.060
Do you really want
to face trial in court?

01:38.900 --> 01:40.330
How dare you hit me?

01:40.330 --> 01:41.900
So what if I hit you?

01:42.660 --> 01:44.730
If not for you,

01:45.130 --> 01:46.540
how could I have made

01:46.540 --> 01:48.620
one mistake after another?

01:48.620 --> 01:51.370
Did you really poison her?

01:51.410 --> 01:53.980
Ke never offended you.

01:54.900 --> 01:58.160
Why would you harm her like this?

01:58.180 --> 01:59.630
Do you think

01:59.650 --> 02:02.340
I was born ambitious?

02:03.090 --> 02:04.250
Do you think

02:04.250 --> 02:06.880
I was born malicious?

02:06.900 --> 02:08.700
It was all because of you.

02:08.700 --> 02:09.740
It was because of you.

02:09.740 --> 02:11.030
It was because of all of you.

02:11.050 --> 02:12.880
You forced me into this.

02:12.900 --> 02:14.140
You are the true executioners

02:14.140 --> 02:16.850
who killed Su Ke.

02:20.250 --> 02:21.810
That year,

02:22.650 --> 02:25.130
at the spring banquet
in Willow Garden,

02:25.740 --> 02:28.130
you held my hand

02:28.740 --> 02:31.250
and said you liked me

02:31.530 --> 02:35.650
and wanted me to marry your son.

02:36.700 --> 02:38.140
And yet you

02:38.700 --> 02:41.970
fell for a merchant's daughter,

02:42.180 --> 02:45.530
insisting on canceling our engagement.

02:45.980 --> 02:47.490
Everyone in my family

02:47.490 --> 02:49.970
laughed at me.

02:51.020 --> 02:52.120
Lady Jiang,

02:52.140 --> 02:53.620
you hypocritically claimed

02:53.620 --> 02:55.680
to be looking out for me,

02:55.700 --> 02:58.650
telling me to marry your second son.

02:59.020 --> 03:02.000
Fine. I did as you wished.

03:02.020 --> 03:04.280
I married Anmou.

03:04.300 --> 03:06.580
I had planned to live a quiet

03:06.580 --> 03:09.030
and proper life.

03:09.050 --> 03:10.490
But you...

03:10.700 --> 03:14.880
You despised Su Ke's background,

03:14.900 --> 03:18.030
pushing me to compete with her.

03:18.050 --> 03:19.750
When I couldn't win,

03:19.770 --> 03:22.410
you blamed me for being foolish.

03:22.460 --> 03:23.330
Now, Su Ke is dead.

03:23.330 --> 03:26.300
Isn't that exactly what you wanted?

03:27.490 --> 03:28.830
Mother is not like that.

03:28.830 --> 03:30.250
You must not speak of her this way.

03:30.250 --> 03:31.620
Shut up.

03:31.620 --> 03:34.740
You self-righteous hypocrite.

03:37.210 --> 03:40.350
You envied Brother inheriting his title

03:40.370 --> 03:42.840
and resented his family's happiness,

03:42.860 --> 03:44.510
so you took it out on me,

03:44.530 --> 03:47.190
forcing me to compete with Su Ke.

03:47.210 --> 03:48.420
But when have you ever

03:48.420 --> 03:50.330
treated me with the respect and care

03:50.330 --> 03:53.470
a proper wife deserves
like Brother treated Su Ke?

03:53.490 --> 03:55.810
I bore your children

03:55.810 --> 03:58.510
and managed this household,

03:58.530 --> 04:01.630
yet have you ever truly looked at me?

04:01.650 --> 04:04.350
Has anyone in this family

04:04.370 --> 04:07.030
ever truly looked at me?

04:07.050 --> 04:08.180
Who am I?

04:08.180 --> 04:10.130
Do I even have a name?

04:10.130 --> 04:13.870
I am merely a pawn in your hands.

04:13.890 --> 04:15.810
I can only fight for myself

04:15.810 --> 04:17.860
and seize what I can

04:17.860 --> 04:19.340
to secure

04:19.340 --> 04:22.220
my place in this household.

04:28.660 --> 04:30.850
And now, how wonderful.

04:32.980 --> 04:34.900
Su Ke is dead.

04:37.180 --> 04:39.640
The First Branch is finished.

04:39.660 --> 04:41.970
I am now the mistress

04:42.540 --> 04:44.530
of this household.

04:45.540 --> 04:48.380
Don't you have to praise me

04:49.100 --> 04:52.020
for being a virtuous wife?

04:54.890 --> 04:57.610
You are still deceiving yourself.

04:58.570 --> 05:01.430
You poisoned my mother.

05:01.450 --> 05:02.540
When my mother died,

05:02.540 --> 05:04.460
she was still so young.

05:04.810 --> 05:07.530
You made my father live
in sorrow for half his life.

05:08.010 --> 05:09.150
You left my siblings and me

05:09.150 --> 05:10.450
without a mother since childhood,

05:10.450 --> 05:12.220
suffering endlessly.

05:12.490 --> 05:14.160
You have a child too.

05:14.180 --> 05:15.520
You are a mother as well.

05:15.540 --> 05:17.910
Have you ever felt even a shred of pity?

05:17.930 --> 05:19.400
Give me back my mother's life.

05:19.420 --> 05:21.980
Give me back my mother's life.

05:21.980 --> 05:23.420
Stop.

05:32.450 --> 05:34.970
I may hate you,

05:35.450 --> 05:41.700
but I never intended to kill her.

05:42.050 --> 05:45.970
I was deceived too.

05:46.890 --> 05:48.470
(When Su Ke was pregnant, )

05:48.490 --> 05:50.230
(I was managing the household
in her place.)

05:50.250 --> 05:51.960
(I only wanted to find a remedy)

05:51.980 --> 05:54.470
(to slow her recovery)

05:54.490 --> 05:55.420
(so that)

05:55.440 --> 05:57.180
- (I could continue)
- Miraculous medicine!

05:57.180 --> 06:00.080
- (managing the household.)
- It's from Hua Tuo!

06:00.250 --> 06:01.960
Do you have any medicine

06:01.980 --> 06:04.030
that can slow a woman's recovery

06:04.050 --> 06:06.020
after childbirth?

06:06.570 --> 06:07.760
Ma'am,

06:07.780 --> 06:09.600
you've come to the right person.

06:09.620 --> 06:11.200
This kind of unconventional medicine

06:11.220 --> 06:12.340
is not something you'd find

06:12.340 --> 06:13.720
in an ordinary pharmacy,

06:13.740 --> 06:16.530
but I can prepare
a special dose for you.

06:17.010 --> 06:18.840
As for the price...

06:18.860 --> 06:20.340
Money is not an issue.

06:20.570 --> 06:23.030
(What are the ingredients?)

06:23.050 --> 06:24.280
(It won't be fatal, will it?)

06:24.300 --> 06:25.740
(This medicine)

06:25.740 --> 06:26.770
(will only weaken her, )

06:26.790 --> 06:28.490
(leaving her frail
for three to five years)

06:28.490 --> 06:29.870
(before she fully recovers, )

06:29.890 --> 06:31.230
(but her life won't be in danger.)

06:31.250 --> 06:32.840
(Following the physician's advice, )

06:32.860 --> 06:34.300
(I put the medicine)

06:34.300 --> 06:36.910
(into the bathwater
Su Ke used to cleanse herself.)

06:36.930 --> 06:38.520
(But I never expected)

06:38.540 --> 06:40.280
(that after giving birth to Miss Si, )

06:40.300 --> 06:42.320
(Su Ke would fall ill and die.)

06:42.340 --> 06:43.350
(After that, )

06:43.370 --> 06:45.990
(years passed peacefully.)

06:46.010 --> 06:47.780
(I thought it was all over.)

06:47.780 --> 06:48.690
(Unexpectedly, )

06:48.690 --> 06:49.890
(a few days ago...)

06:49.890 --> 06:51.350
Who are you?

06:51.370 --> 06:53.090
Why did you bring me here?

06:56.010 --> 06:57.340
We need you

06:57.340 --> 06:59.490
to do one more thing for us.

07:05.690 --> 07:07.820
You said someone deceived you.

07:08.340 --> 07:10.170
Then tell me.

07:10.370 --> 07:11.300
Who ordered you

07:11.300 --> 07:13.090
to kill my mother?

07:22.130 --> 07:23.970
That woman,

07:24.740 --> 07:28.090
though dressed as a merchant's wife,

07:28.540 --> 07:31.350
wore silk from Langzhong

07:31.370 --> 07:34.850
as her inner garment.

07:35.490 --> 07:37.610
That is a material

07:37.810 --> 07:40.340
only the imperial family possesses.

07:40.620 --> 07:42.260
Imperial possessions...

07:43.100 --> 07:44.990
Is that person of imperial blood?

07:45.010 --> 07:46.670
What did that person look like?

07:46.690 --> 07:47.980
Who exactly ordered you?

07:47.980 --> 07:49.420
Enough.

07:49.540 --> 07:51.490
What imperial family?

07:52.250 --> 07:53.420
The one who killed your mother

07:53.420 --> 07:55.090
was none other than Xiao.

07:55.130 --> 07:57.290
No one ordered her.

07:58.220 --> 08:00.410
This matter ends here.

08:00.570 --> 08:01.910
Anmou,

08:01.930 --> 08:03.910
Xiao is your wife.

08:03.930 --> 08:06.160
She murdered her sister-in-law
and framed her niece.

08:06.180 --> 08:07.550
You decide

08:07.570 --> 08:09.170
how she should be punished.

08:10.860 --> 08:12.300
A murderer

08:12.570 --> 08:13.840
must pay with her life.

08:13.860 --> 08:15.550
She will end her own life

08:15.570 --> 08:18.220
to appease my sister-in-law's spirit.

08:19.570 --> 08:21.010
Father!

08:21.340 --> 08:22.780
Father!

08:23.290 --> 08:24.850
Father!

08:31.340 --> 08:32.820
Look.

08:34.130 --> 08:36.300
Your father

08:37.620 --> 08:40.970
also chooses the easy target.

08:44.080 --> 08:48.040
(Cultivate Virtue
and Uphold Righteousness)

08:48.060 --> 08:49.970
With things as they are today,

08:50.410 --> 08:52.850
I have to sacrifice a pawn.

08:53.100 --> 08:56.560
If Xiao does not take her own life,

08:56.580 --> 08:58.220
I will no longer be able to face Mother

08:58.220 --> 08:59.660
and Ancheng.

09:02.250 --> 09:03.720
If she lives,

09:03.740 --> 09:04.840
Capital Security

09:04.860 --> 09:06.840
will continue investigating.

09:06.860 --> 09:08.040
By then,

09:08.060 --> 09:09.800
our entire family

09:09.820 --> 09:12.370
may be dragged down with her.

09:20.860 --> 09:22.270
Shu,

09:22.290 --> 09:24.580
you understand me, don't you?

09:26.010 --> 09:27.890
Master, you're thinking ahead.

09:31.340 --> 09:33.230
It's been hard on you these years.

09:33.940 --> 09:35.660
Once Xiao is gone,

09:35.890 --> 09:38.200
the affairs of this household

09:38.220 --> 09:40.610
will be yours to manage.

09:41.370 --> 09:43.250
Master, as you wish.

09:44.460 --> 09:45.900
Good.

09:51.980 --> 09:53.420
Should I go

09:54.250 --> 09:56.060
to Yaxin Chamber

09:56.290 --> 09:58.250
to see her off one last time?

10:01.370 --> 10:03.060
You should.

10:30.740 --> 10:32.180
Mother,

10:32.220 --> 10:33.920
Father let you manage the house.

10:33.940 --> 10:35.340
Why do you

10:35.340 --> 10:36.850
not seem happy?

10:37.010 --> 10:37.860
Ms. Xiao used

10:37.860 --> 10:39.580
to make things hard for us.

10:40.170 --> 10:42.420
Of course, I'm happy to take charge.

10:43.890 --> 10:45.230
But after all these years,

10:45.250 --> 10:47.700
she managed the household,
bore children,

10:47.740 --> 10:49.470
and paved the way for Master.

10:51.740 --> 10:53.300
Yet in the end,

10:53.530 --> 10:55.700
she was forced to take her own life.

10:58.620 --> 10:59.580
If Master could treat

10:59.580 --> 11:01.460
his wife this way,

11:03.370 --> 11:05.820
how would he treat me in the future?

11:06.430 --> 11:12.210
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

11:14.100 --> 11:17.340
I'm Xiao from Earl Dongping's family,

11:17.370 --> 11:18.770
deceived by others,

11:18.770 --> 11:21.270
poisoned Ms. Su of the family

11:21.290 --> 11:23.300
and her daughter, Jiang Si,

11:23.740 --> 11:25.960
committing an unforgivable crime.

11:25.980 --> 11:27.990
Today, I take my own life to atone.

11:28.010 --> 11:31.850
Please don't blame my daughter,
Jiang Qian, for my sins.

11:32.100 --> 11:33.350
I only wish for my daughter

11:33.370 --> 11:35.230
to live a peaceful life

11:35.250 --> 11:37.700
in the days to come.

11:38.490 --> 11:43.740
♪ I dare not look back
at the road I came from ♪

11:44.220 --> 11:47.330
♪ As the sun sets,
the wise seek redemption ♪

11:47.330 --> 11:50.950
♪ I only wish to wake up one day ♪

11:50.970 --> 11:56.950
♪ I won't lose with myself in the game ♪

11:56.970 --> 12:03.100
♪ Alas, is it too late
to stop indulging myself ♪

12:03.120 --> 12:09.190
♪ Is it too difficult
to be free from sorrow ♪

12:09.210 --> 12:12.210
♪ How many regrets are left ♪

12:12.210 --> 12:15.690
♪ To be remedied ♪

12:15.710 --> 12:21.300
♪ A small greed forms
an unbreakable tie ♪

12:21.320 --> 12:27.380
♪ Is the resting shore too shallow ♪

12:27.400 --> 12:33.380
♪ Is the yearning
in my heart too distant ♪

12:33.400 --> 12:36.560
♪ The wildflowers bloom
across the mountains ♪

12:36.560 --> 12:40.540
♪ Yet I remain trapped ♪

12:41.960 --> 12:47.440
(The 25th Day of the 9th Month,
23rd year of Jingming)

12:47.440 --> 12:51.960
(Xiao)

13:05.650 --> 13:06.920
Ke,

13:06.940 --> 13:08.490
after all these years,

13:09.250 --> 13:10.410
I finally know

13:10.410 --> 13:12.420
how you died.

13:19.170 --> 13:20.820
Do not blame me.

13:23.220 --> 13:25.250
I have wronged you.

13:33.130 --> 13:36.090
(I knew all along who was behind it, )

13:36.770 --> 13:39.540
(but I could not seek justice for you.)

13:40.290 --> 13:42.660
(I was powerless.)

13:49.460 --> 13:50.900
Darling,

13:51.530 --> 13:52.570
I've come to see you off.

13:52.590 --> 13:54.230
- Master.
- Master.

13:54.250 --> 13:55.840
Ms. Xiao is gone.

13:55.860 --> 13:57.300
What?

13:59.620 --> 14:01.720
My wife is already gone?

14:01.740 --> 14:03.700
She didn't die. She escaped.

14:04.530 --> 14:06.090
Escaped?

14:06.490 --> 14:07.840
Ancheng.

14:07.860 --> 14:09.600
Something terrible has happened.

14:09.620 --> 14:12.420
Prince Yan rescued Xiao.

14:12.520 --> 14:15.560
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

14:16.860 --> 14:19.510
Your mother and I were once
in perfect harmony.

14:19.530 --> 14:22.180
How could I not be heartbroken?

14:22.220 --> 14:23.840
But this is not as simple

14:23.860 --> 14:26.420
(Majesty and Prestige)
as you think.

14:26.770 --> 14:28.210
A murderer must pay with their life.

14:28.230 --> 14:29.960
That principle is
not hard to understand.

14:29.980 --> 14:32.470
I do not wish to pursue
this matter further

14:32.490 --> 14:35.080
for the sake of everyone in the family.

14:35.100 --> 14:37.200
I've never asked anything of you before,

14:37.220 --> 14:38.470
but today,

14:38.490 --> 14:40.060
I beg you.

14:40.060 --> 14:42.610
Please, do not act recklessly.

14:44.060 --> 14:46.110
I do not understand your reasoning.

14:46.130 --> 14:47.770
But to me,

14:47.820 --> 14:49.840
Mother's life comes first.

14:49.860 --> 14:51.200
And I believe

14:51.220 --> 14:53.320
justice exists in this world.

14:53.340 --> 14:54.620
Even the imperial family

14:54.620 --> 14:56.340
should not be an exception.

14:56.580 --> 14:58.020
Si...

15:05.940 --> 15:07.540
- Uncle.
- Your Highness.

15:08.410 --> 15:10.870
Your Highness,
please help me persuade Si.

15:10.890 --> 15:13.460
I understand you want
to protect your family.

15:13.980 --> 15:15.990
But whatever she decides,

15:16.010 --> 15:17.610
I will stand by her.

15:20.740 --> 15:22.180
Very well.

15:22.890 --> 15:26.390
Your Highness, please protect Si

15:26.410 --> 15:28.230
and do not let her get hurt.

15:28.250 --> 15:29.690
Rest assured.

15:30.290 --> 15:32.220
I will do everything in my power.

15:32.940 --> 15:34.460
Come and chase me.

15:35.980 --> 15:37.420
Over here.

15:38.010 --> 15:39.680
You can't catch me, can you?

15:39.770 --> 15:41.210
Hurry.

15:42.410 --> 15:43.850
Come on.

15:44.340 --> 15:45.780
Run.

15:51.940 --> 15:55.460
Mother, why are you crying?

15:57.460 --> 15:58.900
It's nothing.

15:59.170 --> 16:00.820
I just...

16:01.650 --> 16:03.770
I miss my mother a little.

16:45.130 --> 16:46.570
Father.

16:46.890 --> 16:48.330
Father.

16:50.370 --> 16:51.970
You're drunk again.

16:53.860 --> 16:55.300
Zhan,

16:58.060 --> 17:02.700
am I a coward?

17:26.540 --> 17:28.090
You had a dream?

17:28.820 --> 17:32.330
I dreamed of Mother blaming us

17:32.890 --> 17:34.580
for not seeking justice

17:34.580 --> 17:36.570
for her sooner.

17:36.730 --> 17:38.810
Dreams aren't real.

17:38.930 --> 17:40.630
You can't take them seriously.

17:40.650 --> 17:42.770
But I just don't understand.

17:43.540 --> 17:46.140
Why is Father acting like this?

17:47.500 --> 17:50.040
Does he not truly love

17:50.060 --> 17:52.100
my mother?

17:53.060 --> 17:55.490
We already know

17:55.620 --> 17:58.010
who the murderer is.

17:58.780 --> 17:59.730
Then why does Father

17:59.730 --> 18:01.620
want to keep the peace?

18:03.100 --> 18:04.840
He's not weak.

18:04.860 --> 18:06.490
He has a weakness.

18:07.300 --> 18:09.280
You and your siblings

18:09.300 --> 18:10.970
are his weakness.

18:13.580 --> 18:15.860
Are you also trying to convince me

18:16.410 --> 18:18.180
to let this go?

18:20.210 --> 18:21.650
No.

18:21.970 --> 18:23.840
I just want to tell you

18:23.860 --> 18:25.950
that however dangerous
the path ahead is,

18:25.970 --> 18:27.710
if you want to take it,

18:27.730 --> 18:29.250
I will go with you.

18:32.340 --> 18:33.780
Thank you.

18:37.680 --> 18:42.880
(Haitang Chamber)

18:43.960 --> 18:46.120
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

18:46.130 --> 18:47.290
Mother,

18:47.310 --> 18:48.170
if Jiang Si is dead,

18:48.170 --> 18:50.140
my marriage will be granted, right?

18:50.620 --> 18:51.690
No wonder you were willing

18:51.690 --> 18:54.050
to wake up early and walk with me today.

18:54.300 --> 18:56.490
So, it was all for your marriage.

18:57.020 --> 18:58.210
I don't want anything else.

18:58.210 --> 19:00.110
I just want to take a walk with you.

19:00.130 --> 19:01.650
Your little schemes

19:01.650 --> 19:03.530
are written all over your face.

19:04.100 --> 19:06.760
Asking directly is always

19:06.780 --> 19:08.490
the worst plan.

19:09.260 --> 19:12.190
If we can get His Majesty
to suggest it himself,

19:12.210 --> 19:14.100
that'd be the best plan.

19:16.100 --> 19:17.540
Mother, you are wise.

19:17.620 --> 19:18.980
As long as the marriage is granted,

19:18.980 --> 19:20.530
it's a win for me.

19:26.730 --> 19:29.730
Ms. Xu, is that your nephew?

19:31.690 --> 19:33.730
Your Highness, please forgive me.

19:33.780 --> 19:35.390
I have warned him many times

19:35.410 --> 19:37.040
not to come here without reason.

19:37.060 --> 19:38.650
I assume his wife

19:38.650 --> 19:40.040
is about to give birth...

19:40.060 --> 19:41.860
- So...
- Say no more.

19:42.580 --> 19:44.190
He is your only family.

19:44.210 --> 19:46.100
It is only right
that you look after him. Go.

19:46.100 --> 19:48.180
Thank you, Your Highness.

19:48.580 --> 19:50.020
Let's go.

19:56.730 --> 19:57.760
Why are you here?

19:57.780 --> 19:59.530
Aunt, something has happened.

20:04.060 --> 20:05.020
Is this true?

20:05.020 --> 20:06.190
Absolutely.

20:06.210 --> 20:08.490
Should we inform Her Highness first?

20:10.450 --> 20:11.890
That'd be unwise.

20:12.260 --> 20:13.690
Her Highness only cares

20:13.690 --> 20:15.940
about results, not the process.

20:16.450 --> 20:17.820
Over the years,

20:17.820 --> 20:20.280
so many people have fought
to get close to her.

20:21.210 --> 20:22.780
Her trust in me

20:22.780 --> 20:24.660
is not what it once was.

20:25.730 --> 20:26.620
This task

20:26.620 --> 20:28.670
must be executed flawlessly.

20:28.690 --> 20:29.950
Yes.

20:29.970 --> 20:32.150
Why are we taking this path?

20:32.170 --> 20:34.080
Why leave through the back gate?

20:34.100 --> 20:35.670
Aunt, this is the place.

20:35.690 --> 20:38.460
What is this place?

20:38.540 --> 20:39.500
This...

20:39.500 --> 20:41.100
You...

20:43.650 --> 20:45.290
You're finally here.

20:48.500 --> 20:50.280
What happened?

20:50.300 --> 20:51.820
This poison could easily

20:51.820 --> 20:53.950
kill Su.

20:53.970 --> 20:55.560
Why did it go wrong

20:55.580 --> 20:57.390
when it came to her daughter?

20:57.410 --> 20:58.970
Who would've thought

20:59.260 --> 21:01.600
Prince Yan had encountered
this poison before

21:01.620 --> 21:03.380
in Nanwu?

21:03.450 --> 21:04.520
He gave Jiang Si

21:04.540 --> 21:06.320
a detoxification formula.

21:06.340 --> 21:08.520
Jiang Si will wake up very soon.

21:08.540 --> 21:10.940
The poison can be cured?

21:11.620 --> 21:13.060
What did you say?

21:13.620 --> 21:15.060
Nothing.

21:15.730 --> 21:16.950
Prince Yan also said

21:16.970 --> 21:18.240
Jiang Si

21:18.260 --> 21:19.710
was so lucky.

21:19.730 --> 21:21.080
If this poison had gone

21:21.100 --> 21:22.560
just a bit deeper,

21:22.580 --> 21:24.150
she would've been dead by now.

21:24.170 --> 21:25.100
That's why

21:25.100 --> 21:26.760
I called you here.

21:26.780 --> 21:28.600
You must think of a solution for me.

21:28.620 --> 21:30.040
If this gets exposed,

21:30.060 --> 21:31.210
I'll be finished.

21:31.210 --> 21:32.700
Why panic?

21:34.690 --> 21:36.250
Let her

21:36.410 --> 21:38.730
get poisoned even deeper.

21:42.780 --> 21:45.010
Ms. Xu, we meet again.

21:45.970 --> 21:47.460
Your Highness.

21:50.580 --> 21:52.620
You're not dead?

21:52.650 --> 21:53.840
Ms. Xu,

21:53.860 --> 21:55.970
I'm afraid it won't go as you wish.

21:56.340 --> 21:57.780
You...

21:58.970 --> 21:59.820
You...

21:59.820 --> 22:01.900
How dare you betray me?

22:04.370 --> 22:05.580
This is the Slumber Flower

22:05.580 --> 22:07.190
unique to Nanwu.

22:07.210 --> 22:08.840
It becomes toxic when it touches water.

22:08.860 --> 22:11.560
It causes vomiting blood, a deep sleep,

22:11.580 --> 22:13.810
and ultimately, death.

22:18.730 --> 22:19.950
This is the Slumber Flower

22:19.970 --> 22:21.190
unique to Nanwu.

22:21.210 --> 22:22.370
Looks like the Grand Princess

22:22.370 --> 22:24.420
has long been colluding with Nanwu.

22:25.060 --> 22:26.100
But Ms. Xu

22:26.100 --> 22:27.870
has served her for years.

22:27.890 --> 22:29.280
She has seen and heard too much.

22:29.300 --> 22:31.280
It won't be easy

22:31.300 --> 22:32.760
to make her talk.

22:32.780 --> 22:34.460
Don't worry. I have a way.

22:35.690 --> 22:37.130
Long Dan.

22:52.860 --> 22:55.250
That's too cruel.

22:55.340 --> 22:57.220
Good for you.

22:57.500 --> 22:58.560
What?

22:58.580 --> 23:01.100
I said good for you.

23:01.260 --> 23:03.290
What? I can't hear it.

23:04.780 --> 23:07.250
I said good for you.

23:16.890 --> 23:17.780
Useless thing.

23:17.780 --> 23:19.040
Forgive me, Your Grace.

23:19.060 --> 23:20.110
Are you all right, Mother?

23:20.130 --> 23:21.570
I'm fine.

23:23.370 --> 23:25.390
What's wrong with Ms. Xu?

23:25.410 --> 23:26.370
She likes to sleep,

23:26.370 --> 23:28.330
and you let her go. That's fine.

23:28.500 --> 23:30.210
Yet she forgot

23:30.210 --> 23:32.000
that your arm injury flares up

23:32.020 --> 23:32.930
in rainy weather,

23:32.930 --> 23:33.860
and only her massage

23:33.860 --> 23:35.700
can relieve the pain.

23:36.130 --> 23:38.220
She's just grown too arrogant.

23:38.300 --> 23:39.900
Enough, enough.

23:40.650 --> 23:42.940
You're giving me a headache.

23:44.020 --> 23:45.450
Her nephew's wife is in labor.

23:45.450 --> 23:47.380
What's she doing over there?

23:47.650 --> 23:49.090
Shijiu.

23:50.110 --> 23:52.250
- Yes?
- Go bring Ms. Xu back.

23:54.260 --> 23:55.910
Why are you standing there?

23:58.820 --> 24:00.260
Go.

24:00.820 --> 24:02.260
Yes.

24:09.410 --> 24:10.800
Well?

24:10.820 --> 24:12.260
Can you talk now?

24:16.450 --> 24:18.480
I've been wanting to talk,

24:18.480 --> 24:19.450
but you stuffed my mouth.

24:19.450 --> 24:21.390
How could I talk then?

24:21.410 --> 24:22.930
The Grand Princess used Nanwu's flower

24:22.930 --> 24:24.770
to kill my mother first,

24:24.860 --> 24:26.730
and now she wants my life too.

24:26.890 --> 24:28.320
Tell me.

24:28.340 --> 24:29.580
What grudge does our family

24:29.580 --> 24:31.290
have against her?

24:31.650 --> 24:35.190
The one who offended the Grand Princess

24:35.210 --> 24:37.860
was your mother, Su Ke.

24:44.130 --> 24:46.490
Your Highness, Ms. Xu is in trouble.

24:49.820 --> 24:50.820
What?

24:50.820 --> 24:53.000
It's all because she had the face

24:53.020 --> 24:55.000
to attract men.

24:55.020 --> 24:57.860
Not only did your father
cancel his engagement,

24:57.860 --> 25:00.390
but even General Cui

25:00.410 --> 25:02.060
defied an imperial marriage decree

25:02.060 --> 25:04.330
for her.

25:04.500 --> 25:07.620
To the Grand Princess,

25:07.780 --> 25:11.380
this was the ultimate disgrace.

25:12.060 --> 25:14.100
My mother and General Cui...?

25:14.540 --> 25:16.760
I always thought you and your sister

25:16.780 --> 25:18.210
were the children of Su

25:18.210 --> 25:20.010
and General Cui.

25:20.130 --> 25:21.660
Ms. Fei, are you referring

25:22.410 --> 25:24.970
to General Cui, Cui Mingyue's father?

25:25.860 --> 25:27.100
My parents were deeply in love.

25:27.100 --> 25:28.760
They were devoted to each other.

25:28.780 --> 25:29.890
Since Mother chose

25:29.890 --> 25:30.910
to marry Father,

25:30.930 --> 25:32.670
how could she possibly
have been entangled

25:32.670 --> 25:33.600
with General Cui?

25:33.620 --> 25:36.860
Your father was devoted to her,

25:37.170 --> 25:41.240
and his career was ruined
because of her.

25:41.260 --> 25:43.730
General Cui, grew estranged

25:43.730 --> 25:47.520
from the Grand Princess for her,

25:47.540 --> 25:50.420
causing them to be a bitter couple.

25:51.540 --> 25:54.180
But your mother, Su Ke,

25:54.260 --> 25:56.900
stole love from others

25:56.920 --> 25:58.060
and was fickle and shameless.

25:58.060 --> 25:59.020
Shut up.

25:59.020 --> 26:00.860
You can't insult my mother.

26:01.210 --> 26:02.320
Ms. Xu,

26:02.340 --> 26:03.110
tell us.

26:03.110 --> 26:04.240
Why does the Grand Princess

26:04.260 --> 26:06.460
have the flower?

26:07.580 --> 26:09.150
Let her feel more comfortable.

26:09.170 --> 26:10.710
Is it itchy?

26:10.730 --> 26:12.020
I'll talk. I'll talk.

26:12.020 --> 26:14.010
That Nanwu woman

26:14.130 --> 26:17.220
seduced the Grand Princess.

26:18.650 --> 26:20.710
Your Highness, this can help you

26:20.730 --> 26:22.380
relieve your troubles.

26:22.410 --> 26:26.000
I heard that Nanwu excels in sorcery.

26:26.020 --> 26:27.910
I once read in a book

26:27.930 --> 26:29.390
about a Nanwu woman

26:29.410 --> 26:31.970
who placed a love curse on her husband,

26:32.130 --> 26:35.660
making him love only her forever.

26:35.730 --> 26:38.250
Could this be the same thing?

26:38.340 --> 26:40.800
That's just a rumor.

26:40.820 --> 26:41.780
If Nanwu

26:41.780 --> 26:43.620
could control people's hearts,

26:43.650 --> 26:46.250
Nanwu's status would've been
very different by now.

26:47.930 --> 26:49.390
Then what exactly is this?

26:49.410 --> 26:51.860
A thing that can make

26:52.100 --> 26:53.700
your enemy disappear.

26:56.260 --> 26:57.700
Ridiculous.

26:58.370 --> 27:01.000
I am the Grand Princess of Dazhou.

27:01.020 --> 27:04.350
It's easy for me to have someone die.

27:04.370 --> 27:05.810
Of course.

27:06.130 --> 27:08.380
You hold great power.

27:08.450 --> 27:09.950
You don't need

27:09.970 --> 27:12.180
to dirty your own hands to kill someone.

27:13.260 --> 27:15.570
I am willing to be your blade.

27:16.300 --> 27:17.670
Just like this thing.

27:17.690 --> 27:20.180
It takes lives silently.

27:20.260 --> 27:21.430
No one

27:21.450 --> 27:23.220
can find out about it.

27:24.730 --> 27:28.900
(Xiao and Su Ke
have never gotten along.)

27:29.060 --> 27:31.480
(Healing Hands)
(We discovered that Xiao)

27:31.500 --> 27:33.390
(was planning to poison Su Ke.)

27:33.410 --> 27:35.350
(Kind, Jishi Clinic)
(So, we bribed the physician)

27:35.370 --> 27:38.700
(to swap the poison for Slumber Flower.)

27:38.820 --> 27:42.390
(We used Xiao to kill Su Ke.)

27:42.410 --> 27:44.460
(Su Ke died, )

27:44.480 --> 27:45.690
(but the Grand Princess's wish)

27:45.690 --> 27:47.970
(was not fulfilled.)

27:48.340 --> 27:51.910
(General Cui became even colder
toward her.)

27:51.930 --> 27:54.000
(Yet that Nanwu woman)

27:54.020 --> 27:55.130
(only gained more)

27:55.130 --> 27:57.530
(of the Grand Princess's trust.)

27:57.730 --> 28:00.000
Where is this Nanwu woman now?

28:00.020 --> 28:02.860
She is a mystery.

28:02.860 --> 28:04.930
Every time she came, she wore a veil.

28:04.950 --> 28:07.770
How would I know where she is?

28:08.690 --> 28:09.800
Ms. Xu,

28:09.820 --> 28:12.320
you knew this flower could be evidence.

28:12.340 --> 28:14.100
If an investigation starts,

28:14.100 --> 28:15.260
the Grand Princess

28:15.260 --> 28:16.860
may be able to shift the blame.

28:16.860 --> 28:18.040
But you cannot.

28:18.060 --> 28:20.190
You don't want to betray your master,

28:20.210 --> 28:21.500
so you made up some story

28:21.500 --> 28:23.080
about a Nanwu woman

28:23.100 --> 28:25.100
to lead us nowhere.

28:25.130 --> 28:26.320
Long Dan, continue.

28:26.340 --> 28:27.210
No, no, no.

28:27.210 --> 28:29.410
Don't, don't.

28:29.410 --> 28:30.930
Let me think.

28:30.930 --> 28:32.770
Go ahead. Take your time.

28:33.540 --> 28:34.780
I remember now.

28:34.780 --> 28:37.340
That Nanwu woman

28:37.340 --> 28:40.010
asked the Grand Princess
to help her enter the Palace.

28:40.930 --> 28:43.150
She is now in Changning Palace.

28:43.170 --> 28:44.610
Changning Palace?

28:44.780 --> 28:46.660
That's the Empress's Palace.

28:46.780 --> 28:48.910
If the Grand Princess

28:48.930 --> 28:50.410
finds out

28:50.410 --> 28:52.770
I told you all this,

28:52.820 --> 28:54.240
then

28:54.260 --> 28:57.100
the three of us

28:57.170 --> 28:58.840
are as good as dead.

28:58.860 --> 29:00.110
I have a plan.

29:00.130 --> 29:02.100
Just pretend you never saw me

29:02.100 --> 29:03.100
and I was never here.

29:03.100 --> 29:04.690
Let's pretend nothing happened, right?

29:04.690 --> 29:05.620
Yes, yes.

29:05.620 --> 29:07.180
What a joke.

29:07.650 --> 29:08.890
Do you think my mother's death

29:08.890 --> 29:10.080
was for nothing?

29:10.100 --> 29:12.450
Are you planning

29:12.450 --> 29:14.410
to go against the Grand Princess?

29:14.410 --> 29:16.730
Even a Prince is bound by the law.

29:17.650 --> 29:19.280
How naive.

29:19.300 --> 29:20.620
The Grand Princess is

29:20.620 --> 29:23.870
His Majesty's dearest sister,

29:23.890 --> 29:26.080
second only to the Emperor himself.

29:26.100 --> 29:28.480
Forget your mother.

29:28.500 --> 29:30.910
Even when nobles died

29:30.930 --> 29:34.390
in the Jinshui River fire,

29:34.410 --> 29:37.240
Princess Mingyue only lost her title.

29:37.260 --> 29:38.630
Do you really think

29:38.650 --> 29:41.060
His Majesty would punish his sister

29:41.060 --> 29:42.690
over a mere merchant's daughter?

29:42.690 --> 29:44.340
Colluding with Nanwu is treason.

29:44.340 --> 29:45.410
His dearest sister?

29:45.430 --> 29:47.340
Do you think His Majesty
will turn a blind eye?

29:47.340 --> 29:48.730
The Grand Princess is...

29:48.730 --> 29:49.970
Your Highness, Miss,

29:49.970 --> 29:52.060
there's suddenly a large group outside.

29:58.540 --> 29:59.780
Your Highness, why did you

29:59.780 --> 30:01.240
barge into my mansion?

30:01.260 --> 30:03.770
How can you accuse me first?

30:04.260 --> 30:06.800
You kidnapped Ms. Xu from my mansion,

30:06.820 --> 30:09.900
yet now you're asking me why I'm here?

30:10.260 --> 30:12.670
Shijiu, what are you waiting for?

30:12.690 --> 30:14.130
Search.

30:24.060 --> 30:25.020
Your Highness.

30:25.020 --> 30:27.010
Your Highness, save me.

30:27.170 --> 30:28.950
They tricked me into coming here.

30:28.970 --> 30:30.060
I didn't say anything.

30:30.060 --> 30:31.280
I know nothing.

30:31.300 --> 30:32.910
- Shut up.
- I know nothing.

30:32.930 --> 30:34.370
Let's go.

30:37.100 --> 30:38.710
Don't harm Her Highness.

30:38.730 --> 30:41.530
Jiang Si, what are you trying to do?

30:41.620 --> 30:43.420
Are you going to kill me?

30:44.100 --> 30:46.860
Come on, kill me.

30:46.860 --> 30:48.700
Come on, kill me then.

30:50.860 --> 30:52.300
Jiang Si from Earl Dongping's family

30:52.300 --> 30:54.170
attempted to murder a Princess.

30:54.170 --> 30:55.610
Seize her.

30:57.340 --> 31:00.330
Yu Jin, you arranged this.

31:00.730 --> 31:01.890
You planned everything.

31:01.890 --> 31:03.080
Are you trying to rebel?

31:03.100 --> 31:05.050
Do you think

31:05.540 --> 31:07.730
I won't have you all killed?

31:08.410 --> 31:11.100
An imperial decree has arrived.

31:17.060 --> 31:18.500
Rongyang,

31:19.340 --> 31:20.860
what are you doing here?

31:20.970 --> 31:23.010
You certainly got the news fast,

31:23.340 --> 31:24.910
rushing here to save

31:24.930 --> 31:27.010
her daughter.

31:32.860 --> 31:34.630
Prince Yan, receive the decree.

31:34.690 --> 31:36.110
By His Majesty's command,

31:36.130 --> 31:38.390
Prince Yan, Yu Jin,

31:38.410 --> 31:40.320
shall enter the Palace at once.

31:40.340 --> 31:42.570
I accept the decree.

31:46.730 --> 31:48.950
But I must trouble General Cui

31:48.970 --> 31:50.190
to report to His Majesty

31:50.210 --> 31:52.950
that it seems Her Highness
wishes to stop me

31:52.970 --> 31:54.390
from meeting him.

31:54.410 --> 31:55.850
How could Her Highness

31:56.210 --> 31:58.940
trouble her own nephew?

31:59.210 --> 32:00.390
Let's go.

32:00.410 --> 32:02.050
Ms. Xu stays.

32:02.100 --> 32:04.000
I've already let it go,

32:04.020 --> 32:05.860
but you keep pushing your luck.

32:05.860 --> 32:07.970
Ms. Xu just admitted

32:08.060 --> 32:10.000
she poisoned my mother to death.

32:10.020 --> 32:11.910
If you leave
with the Grand Princess now,

32:11.930 --> 32:13.520
she will kill you to silence you.

32:13.540 --> 32:14.980
Wait.

32:16.060 --> 32:17.500
Poison?

32:17.620 --> 32:19.040
Who killed your mother?

32:19.060 --> 32:21.110
Didn't Su Ke die of illness?

32:21.130 --> 32:23.530
The Grand Princess, out of jealousy,

32:23.730 --> 32:25.130
ordered Ms. Xu to use

32:25.130 --> 32:26.970
a deadly poison to kill her.

32:30.730 --> 32:32.330
Is this true?

32:33.060 --> 32:34.200
Is it?

32:34.220 --> 32:35.060
Tell me.

32:35.060 --> 32:36.640
Ms. Xu, tell the truth.

32:36.660 --> 32:38.370
Prince Yan and General Cui
are both here.

32:38.370 --> 32:40.650
The Grand Princess doesn't rule Dazhou.

32:40.650 --> 32:44.320
I deserve death, Your Highness.

32:44.340 --> 32:45.500
I don't know what drug

32:45.500 --> 32:46.780
they fed me,

32:46.780 --> 32:48.870
but I lost my senses for a moment.

32:48.890 --> 32:51.870
General Cui, you must not believe them.

32:51.890 --> 32:54.020
It will only cause a rift between you

32:54.020 --> 32:56.370
and the Grand Princess.

32:56.370 --> 32:58.570
How cunning.

32:58.620 --> 33:01.140
You heard Ms. Xu.

33:01.780 --> 33:04.460
Do you believe my servant

33:04.500 --> 33:06.570
or her daughter?

33:11.450 --> 33:12.890
Let's go.

33:21.650 --> 33:23.080
Miss Jiang,

33:23.100 --> 33:25.110
what is the truth

33:25.130 --> 33:26.660
about your mother's death?

33:33.410 --> 33:35.190
General Cui.

33:35.200 --> 33:36.620
General Cui, don't.

33:57.500 --> 33:58.940
Stop.

34:15.650 --> 34:17.330
How long has it been

34:18.650 --> 34:21.220
since we sat down for a meal together?

34:23.420 --> 34:26.560
General Cui is always occupied,

34:26.580 --> 34:29.770
rushing from one military camp
to another.

34:30.170 --> 34:32.500
How would you have time

34:32.500 --> 34:34.220
to dine with me?

34:34.980 --> 34:36.420
Rongyang,

34:38.310 --> 34:40.180
why do you always speak

34:41.330 --> 34:43.450
with thorns in your words?

34:43.540 --> 34:46.330
I am the Grand Princess of Dazhou.

34:46.540 --> 34:47.880
Apart from my brother,

34:47.900 --> 34:49.920
every man in this world

34:49.940 --> 34:51.770
must kneel to speak to me.

34:52.130 --> 34:53.480
Remember that.

34:53.500 --> 34:54.500
I will never lower myself

34:54.500 --> 34:56.880
like that lowly merchant's daughter

34:56.900 --> 34:57.980
to please you

34:57.980 --> 35:00.370
with sweet words.

35:06.580 --> 35:07.980
Su Ke has been dead

35:07.980 --> 35:10.140
for so many years,

35:12.210 --> 35:14.380
yet you still

35:14.380 --> 35:15.820
call her lowly?

35:16.330 --> 35:17.770
Let me tell you.

35:19.020 --> 35:20.890
To me,

35:21.850 --> 35:23.600
she was the best,

35:23.620 --> 35:25.060
the noblest woman

35:25.810 --> 35:27.930
in the world.

35:32.810 --> 35:34.500
So, I killed her.

35:35.330 --> 35:36.670
So, she'll never grow old,

35:36.690 --> 35:38.250
never change,

35:38.770 --> 35:40.880
and forever remain beautiful

35:40.900 --> 35:42.660
and noble in your heart.

35:45.100 --> 35:47.100
You loved Su Ke,

35:47.500 --> 35:49.850
but she died because of you.

35:51.060 --> 35:53.190
If you want to revenge,

35:53.210 --> 35:55.230
you shouldn't just blame me.

35:55.250 --> 35:56.770
In the end,

35:57.290 --> 35:59.370
you should blame yourself.

36:00.330 --> 36:01.770
Enough.

36:02.170 --> 36:04.150
We are already married.

36:04.170 --> 36:05.380
Why couldn't you let her go?

36:05.380 --> 36:06.850
Why?

36:06.900 --> 36:09.220
She wouldn't let you go.

36:09.540 --> 36:11.580
She was already married,

36:11.810 --> 36:12.980
so why did she still meet you

36:12.980 --> 36:14.600
in secret at Qingyin Temple?

36:14.620 --> 36:15.750
Your Highness,

36:15.770 --> 36:18.850
General Cui rode out of the city
early this morning,

36:18.900 --> 36:20.790
heading toward Qingyin Temple.

36:20.810 --> 36:22.790
He doesn't believe in gods.

36:22.810 --> 36:23.850
Why would he go there?

36:23.860 --> 36:25.580
The people watching
Earl Dongping's Mansion

36:25.580 --> 36:26.830
just reported

36:26.850 --> 36:29.480
that Su Ke also took a carriage

36:29.500 --> 36:30.960
to Qingyin Temple.

36:30.980 --> 36:32.420
What?

36:42.620 --> 36:44.060
Your Highness,

36:44.250 --> 36:46.620
do we need to go in to check?

36:48.330 --> 36:50.700
Let's go back.

36:50.770 --> 36:54.290
How many times must I tell you?

36:54.690 --> 36:55.980
That day, I went

36:55.980 --> 36:58.100
to Qingyin Temple alone.

36:58.540 --> 37:01.360
Su Ke and I were innocent.

37:01.380 --> 37:04.270
After we married, we never met again.

37:04.290 --> 37:05.850
I don't believe you.

37:06.330 --> 37:08.410
She lingered around you.

37:08.620 --> 37:10.290
You both deserved to die.

37:10.290 --> 37:11.730
Rongyang,

37:13.100 --> 37:15.180
you never believed me.

37:16.210 --> 37:18.410
Never.

37:45.250 --> 37:48.370
(That day, I went
to Qingyin Temple alone)

37:48.420 --> 37:51.100
(to put the past behind me.)

38:19.810 --> 38:21.290
Do you really think...

38:22.380 --> 38:24.770
Do you really think that Su Ke

38:25.980 --> 38:28.180
was the only reason
we ended up like this?

38:34.170 --> 38:35.810
Wasn't she?

38:43.100 --> 38:44.850
Wasn't she?

38:47.620 --> 38:49.060
Forget it.

38:51.210 --> 38:52.650
Forget it.

38:54.850 --> 38:56.230
Come on.

38:56.250 --> 38:58.660
Sit. Drink this wine.

39:02.980 --> 39:04.420
Sit down.

39:18.170 --> 39:20.020
Drink this wine.

39:20.460 --> 39:22.730
Let the past

39:22.980 --> 39:25.100
be forgotten.

39:42.620 --> 39:44.620
You want to divorce me?

39:45.580 --> 39:47.770
At our age,

39:48.620 --> 39:50.210
what use is a mere piece

39:50.210 --> 39:51.730
of divorce paper?

39:53.850 --> 39:55.450
Drink this wine,

39:56.580 --> 40:00.450
and consider our marriage over.

40:01.940 --> 40:05.450
From now on, we part ways.

40:07.060 --> 40:08.230
Rongyang.

40:08.250 --> 40:10.180
Stop tormenting me,

40:12.420 --> 40:16.660
and stop tormenting yourself.

40:39.690 --> 40:41.330
I told you before

40:43.420 --> 40:44.890
that I'm not a woman

40:45.690 --> 40:47.450
who begs and pleads

40:47.540 --> 40:49.810
before men.

40:51.770 --> 40:53.500
All these years,

40:54.460 --> 40:57.040
you came and went as you pleased.

40:57.060 --> 40:58.980
Have I ever stopped you?

41:01.170 --> 41:02.770
In that case,

41:04.540 --> 41:05.980
after this wine,

41:07.250 --> 41:11.560
let us sever all ties.

41:11.580 --> 41:13.020
Don't drink it.

41:17.900 --> 41:20.410
Father. Mother.

41:22.420 --> 41:23.930
You want to kill me?

41:37.330 --> 41:38.930
You want to kill me?

41:40.500 --> 41:42.540
You want to kill yourself too?

41:42.620 --> 41:44.380
Are you going to take both our lives

41:44.380 --> 41:47.060
to atone for that wretched woman?

41:49.980 --> 41:51.450
Mingyue.

41:52.290 --> 41:54.580
From today on,

41:55.980 --> 41:57.730
you no longer have a father.

41:58.100 --> 41:59.730
Mother, Father just...

41:59.730 --> 42:01.170
Shut up.

42:03.540 --> 42:05.180
If you still acknowledge him,

42:05.620 --> 42:07.770
then do not call me Mother again.

42:08.420 --> 42:09.860
Mother...

42:15.170 --> 42:16.610
Father...

42:17.060 --> 42:18.500
Guards.

42:19.460 --> 42:20.600
Your Highness.

42:20.620 --> 42:22.620
From today on,

42:23.540 --> 42:24.790
Cui Xu

42:24.810 --> 42:27.620
shall not set foot in my mansion again.

42:27.650 --> 42:29.980
General, please leave.

42:48.000 --> 42:52.360
(The End of Episode 29)

42:52.771 --> 42:54.501
♪ From place to place ♪

42:54.501 --> 42:59.441
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

42:59.811 --> 43:02.191
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:02.191 --> 43:06.421
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:07.131 --> 43:09.531
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:09.551 --> 43:13.211
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:13.231 --> 43:16.651
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:16.801 --> 43:22.321
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:23.141 --> 43:26.821
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:26.821 --> 43:30.901
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:31.141 --> 43:32.881
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:32.901 --> 43:37.601
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:37.601 --> 43:41.171
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:41.191 --> 43:45.421
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:45.441 --> 43:47.221
♪ Time glows ♪

43:47.221 --> 43:51.761
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:51.781 --> 43:56.581
♪ And stars ♪

44:00.811 --> 44:03.341
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:03.361 --> 44:06.981
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:07.001 --> 44:10.431
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:10.451 --> 44:15.071
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:15.071 --> 44:18.761
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:18.781 --> 44:22.871
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:22.981 --> 44:24.801
♪ Time glows ♪

44:24.801 --> 44:29.351
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:29.371 --> 44:33.071
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:33.091 --> 44:37.251
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:37.431 --> 44:39.191
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:39.191 --> 44:43.711
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:43.711 --> 44:47.351
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:47.371 --> 44:53.041
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:54.731 --> 44:56.661
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:56.661 --> 45:04.161
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
